"Layouts (HBox, VBox, GridPane, BorderPane, FlowPane, StackPane) position controls; events call handlers, usually lambdas.": "Layout (HBox, VBox, GridPane, BorderPane, FlowPane, StackPane) control বসায়; event handler call করে, সাধারণত lambda।",
